extraStrings:
- type: en-US
  strings:
    STR_COBRA_FRONT: Cobra Front
    STR_COBRA_FRONT_MISSION: Front Company Set-up
    STR_COBRA_FRONT_RAID: RAID ON A COBRA FRONT
    STR_COBRA_FRONT_RAID_BRIEFING: 'Behind the sign is one of the Crimson Twins'' front companies: a warehouse that moves Cobra money and Cobra cargo under a legitimate name. The guards inside know the
      building and will hold it.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Clear the building. Recover the books -- every front keeps two sets -- and the operation is finished.'
    STR_COBRA_LEDGERS: Cobra Ledgers
    STR_COBRA_LEDGERS_UFOPEDIA: 'The second set of books from a Cobra front company: shipping manifests, shell-company accounts and wire transfers.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Sold through the right channels the accounts
      are worth a great deal of money to us and cost Cobra the same. Read closely, they show where the money goes next.'
- type: en-GB
  strings:
    STR_COBRA_FRONT: Cobra Front
    STR_COBRA_FRONT_MISSION: Front Company Set-up
    STR_COBRA_FRONT_RAID: RAID ON A COBRA FRONT
    STR_COBRA_FRONT_RAID_BRIEFING: 'Behind the sign is one of the Crimson Twins'' front companies: a warehouse that moves Cobra money and Cobra cargo under a legitimate name. The guards inside know the
      building and will hold it.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Clear the building. Recover the books -- every front keeps two sets -- and the operation is finished.'
    STR_COBRA_LEDGERS: Cobra Ledgers
    STR_COBRA_LEDGERS_UFOPEDIA: 'The second set of books from a Cobra front company: shipping manifests, shell-company accounts and wire transfers.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Sold through the right channels the accounts
      are worth a great deal of money to us and cost Cobra the same. Read closely, they show where the money goes next.'
